==[Module i18n]

UI strings and internationalization dictionaries for stela-shelf-assets.

===[Module en]

====[Functions]

=====[fn ui_strings]

The interface's text in English.

===[Module ja]

====[Functions]

=====[fn ui_strings]

The interface's text in Japanese (default).

===[Functions]

====[fn is_english]

Returns true if the given language code represents English (e.g. "en", "en-US").

====[fn default_ui_strings_for]

Look up default UI strings for a given book language code.

====[fn apply_ui_defaults]

Populate missing UI strings in `strings` based on `lang`, preserving user overrides.

==[Functions]

===[fn stela_static_assets]

Get all core static assets for Stela Shelf (CSS, JS, components, and icon sprites).

